    "independentPair": "Steve and Elena",
    "challenge": "Before-only cancellation misses reads started during a write. Disabling Save while reading blocks users and does not control another observer. Exact cancellation at both boundaries preserves provider isolation without another success status read.",
    "failureReview": "Elena confirmed invalidation alone can reuse a cold in-flight read. Final error callbacks cancel exact status before invalidating, do not await the repair, and preserve mounted draft/error/editability.",
    "finalReview": "Elena found no remaining actionable issue in the final source.",
    "ownership": "Morgan implemented. Shared status caches publish across initiator unmount; NewsTest only guards its local field update."
