  "freshness": "First13 native snapshots precede only the additional failure-path cancellation. Final4 cold snapshots use final renderer build and verify the corrected failure path. Success ordering is unchanged by that localized correction.",
  "limitations": [
    "Shared Keychain adapter is stubbed. No personal entry, provider validity, live provider delivery or exhaustive OS storage failure is tested.",
    "Post-write confirmation error is injected after an actual disposable local write. It models failure after state changes; it is not a claim that every partial write branch was exercised.",
    "An initial cold delayed-failure adapter checked commitFail only before its hold, so it completed successfully instead of injecting the error. That intermediate run is excluded. The corrected adapter checks after release; final case starts a third fresh status read on error while two older reads remain held.",
    "NewsTest has no current render caller and is verified by source inspection/build only. No native NewsTest journey is claimed.",
    "Mounted-form failure draft/error retention is verified. Key mutation draft/pending/error retention across navigation is not established; the detour proves shared cache publication and invalidation ordering only.",
    "Internal Keychain read/write serialization, VoiceOver, listener understanding, audible quality and other devices remain separate. Normal local playback saves/status polling continue."
